(4, 'en', 'help_search', ' importing a single configuration item goal import a single configuration item in yaml format such as one that was previously exported see exporting a single configuration item see managing and deploying configuration for more information about configuration steps in the manage administrative menu navigate to configuration   development   configuration synchronization   import   single item  select the configuration type that you want to import on your computer or other device copy the yamlformat configuration that you want to import to the clipboard paste the clipboard text into the box labeled paste your configuration here  click import   ', 0),
